    "summary": "During your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), pick a single enemy within 18″ that the Plasmancer can see to use **[Living Lightning](vsdata:ability/necrons.plasmancer.living-lightning)**. A [Lone Operative](vsdata:core-ability/lone-operative) target outside an [Attached unit](vsdata:core-rule/attached-units) must be within 12″ instead. For the chosen enemy, throw 4 dice (D6). Every result of 4+ deals 1 [mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).",
